== #29682 Santa Clarita Valley Sheriff's Station [organizations/organization]
  body: The Santa Clarita Valley Sheriff's Station is the Los Angeles County Sheriff's Department station that polices the valley: the City of Santa Clarita and the unincorporated communities around it, from Castaic and Val Verde to Stevenson Ranch and Sand Canyon.[1] The City has no police department of its own. It contracts with the County for police services, and the station's captain serves as its chief of police; the captain since August 2025 is Brandon Barclay.[2][3]

